# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages security headers (Vercel uses vercel.json).
# The page-level Content-Security-Policy with script/style hashes is emitted by Astro as a <meta> tag;
# frame-ancestors and upgrade-insecure-requests only work as real headers, so they live here.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/compare/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
